&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role can be office-based in Freiburg, Germany or remote-first, with a requirement to be in the office one full week per month.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Black Forest Labs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re the team behind Latent Diffusion, Stable Diffusion, and FLUX—foundational technologies that changed how the world creates images and video. We’re creating the generative models that power how people make images and video—tools used by millions of creators, developers, and businesses worldwide. Our FLUX models are among the most advanced in the world, and we’re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Freiburg, Germany with a growing presence in San Francisco, we’re scaling fast while staying true to what makes us different: research excellence, open science, and building technology that expands human creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our models are already seeing strong inbound demand, and we’re expanding our commercial team to accelerate adoption across enterprise and strategic partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who can translate deep technical interest into durable, long-term partnerships&amp;nbsp; especially across complex, non-standard engagements involving APIs, on-prem deployments, and custom licensing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role owns the end-to-end commercial journey, working closely with research, engineering, and leadership to help customers move confidently from evaluation to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle from discovery through close and expansion across startups, scaleups, and enterprises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run complex, multi-stakeholder deals involving technical buyers, executives, and legal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute sales motions across APIs, on-prem deployments, and custom licensing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build durable customer relationships that drive retention and long-term expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with solutions engineering, forward-deployed engineers, product, research, and legal on bespoke deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer needs and market signals into actionable feedback for product and research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define early commercial processes, playbooks, and qualification frameworks as we scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ve closed real, technically complex B2B deals and know how to operate without a playbook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring strong judgment navigating long sales cycles, highly competitive environments with ambiguous requirements, and evolving products, and you’re comfortable working cross-functionally to get deals done the right way, not just quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll likely have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling technical products to tech executives, ML teams, and enterprise stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to discuss model capabilities, inference requirements, and integration tradeoffs with technical buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success managing long, multi-stakeholder sales cycles and closing strategic landmark deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation skills across pricing, licensing, and custom commercial terms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record building and scaling pipelines across different deal sizes and customer types&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort shaping process and structure in fast-moving, early-stage environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work Together&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a distributed team with real offices that people actually use. Depending on your role, you’ll either join us in Freiburg or SF at least 2 days a week (or one full week every other week), or work remotely with a monthly in-person week to stay connected. We’ll cover reasonable travel costs to make this possible. We think in-person time matters, and we’ve structured things to make it accessible to all. We’ll discuss what this will look like for the role during our interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Everything we do is grounded in four values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Obsessed.&lt;/strong&gt; We are a frontier research lab. The science has to be right, the understanding deep, the product beautiful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Low Ego.&lt;/strong&gt; The work speaks. The best idea wins, no matter who said it. Credit is shared. Nobody is above any task.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bold.&lt;/strong&gt; We take the ambitious bet. We ship, we do not wait for conditions to be perfect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kind.&lt;/strong&gt; People over politics. We treat each other with genuine warmth. Agency without empathy creates chaos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like work you’d enjoy, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Annual Salary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EU &lt;/strong&gt;€150,000 - €185,000 + variable + equity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US &lt;/strong&gt;$180,000 - $210,000 USD + variable + equity&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is reorganising UX to work AI-native — practitioners either go deep as platform and skills experts, or broad as generalists who move fluidly across product, design and engineering to drive experience quality and innovation. This role leads UX for our Operations organisation: the part of the business that bridges technology with physical fulfilment, procurement, quality assurance and supply chain, across every market and brand we operate in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll take over from a Director who spent two years shifting this function from reactive delivery to a high-leverage, AI-native strategic partner — including building an internal design platform, integrated with AI tooling, that other parts of the business have since adopted. You inherit that trajectory, not a finished product: some of our highest-stakes bets for 2026, including how we plan menus algorithmically at scale and how we run the internal tools that power supply-chain decision-making, are still being actively designed, not maintained.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a Berlin-based, in-person leadership role. Operations is one of several major, Berlin-anchored parts of our technology organization, and regular physical presence — with peers, with your team, and in the room for cross-functional decisions — is a deliberate requirement of how we want this function led going forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll own&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UX strategy and quality across four core areas of Operations: menu planning and food systems (algorithmic menu planning, ranking, demand forecasting, assortment), fulfillment (production, order management, inventory, logistics, manufacturing, supplier reliability), an internal operations-research platform that runs dozens of optimization models across the supply chain, and the technology backbone that keeps our warehouses and production sites running.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continued build-out of an AI-native design practice: extending our design system directly into AI-assisted workflows, and using that as proof that UX can lead — not just support — the company&#39;s AI-first agenda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Service design for the internal-facing tools that operators, planners and analysts depend on every day — often the least glamorous and highest-impact surface area in the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent leadership for a distributed team spanning multiple geographies: hiring, career development, and consistent design-quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A seat at the Operations leadership table, partnering directly with the senior Product and Engineering leaders for the organization, and representing UX&#39;s interests in company-wide strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in UX/product design, including several years leading design for complex, operational, or B2B/enterprise-grade systems — supply chain, logistics, marketplace operations, or similar domains are a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shifting a design function from reactive delivery to strategic, AI-native practice — not just familiarity with AI tools, but experience redesigning how a team works because of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or scaling design systems/platforms that other teams adopt, and comfort operating at the intersection of design, product and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management — this role sits at the table with senior product, engineering and exec leadership and needs to hold its own there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and unglamorous domains: this is service design for internal operators and planners, not consumer-facing polish, and the highest-value problems here are rarely the most visible ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Location &amp;amp; ways of working&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in our Berlin office, with an expectation of regular in-person presence — this is one of the small number of senior UX roles at HelloFresh where onsite leadership is a deliberate requirement rather than a preference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Reporting line&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports to HelloFresh&#39;s VP of UX, who also leads UX for two other major parts of the business and reports into senior Product leadership. UX holds a more central, cross-functional reporting line than is typical for Product or Engineering here, reflecting the company&#39;s investment in design and experience quality as a differentiator — with visible sponsorship at the executive level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a new teammate to join us on the journey of keeping HelloFresh a trusted name - someone with a passion for security and appetite for new challenges. Security Engineers work in a variety of ways to constantly iterate and improve HelloFresh’s security posture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the first port of call for responding to any of HelloFresh’s security related questions and concerns. You will also develop and deliver tools and processes to enable colleagues to achieve their goals and objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enhance &lt;/strong&gt;the security posture of the enterprise IT infrastructure, services, and tools by hardening them against abuse and nefarious activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implement &lt;/strong&gt;secure configurations and policies for IAM, EDR, VPN, Firewalls, Email Security, Slack and MDM tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible &lt;/strong&gt;for security hardening and posture of enterprise IT assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adapt &lt;/strong&gt;to modern AI adoption strategy through implementing and mitigating AI controls in a variety of methods including Shadow AI, MCP integrations, and protecting against AI-based risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deploy, optimize and operate &lt;/strong&gt;modern security solutions like EDR, Zero-Trust, SSE/CASB, DLP, and Patch Management tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assist &lt;/strong&gt;in company-wide security awareness campaigns and vulnerability patching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perform &lt;/strong&gt;comparative technical and commercial analysis for various security products/tools prior to procurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience hardening workstations, network equipment, servers, IAM platforms through using CIS/NIST frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding and usage of Generative AI from a corporate perspective, including LLM guardrails, MCP connections/gateways, and risks stemming from its usage such as prompt injections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to perform malware analysis on Windows, MacOS, and Linux machines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of modern-day social engineering attacks and how to prevent them through technical controls and training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth understanding of common TCP/IP protocols and modern-day security threats on each network layer and protecting against them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication and reporting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh Group reaches more than 6 million customers across 16 markets through a portfolio of 8 consumer brands — from meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to pet food and specialty products. HelloTech, our global technology division, builds the digital consumer experience across Berlin, Warsaw, and North America: the apps, the personalization, the discovery moments, and everything in between that turns food into something people genuinely look forward to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design is core to how we compete. Our Consumer UX team designs end-to-end experiences across all 8 brands, and we hold a high quality bar — internally, our “zest-appeal” framework defines design excellence from baseline usability through to best-in-class, surprise-and-delight craft. We are also moving fast to an AI-native way of working, where AI rethinks discovery, prototyping, and the path from design to code. Experience quality and innovation are leadership priorities all the way to the group president.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This year we are doubling down on craft, execution, and design leadership. In a world where it is easier than ever to get software to 75% built, it is the last 25% — the polish, the motion, the detail customers actually feel — that decides whether a consumer experience is merely useful or genuinely loved. Millions of people open our apps every week to feed themselves and their families; the final 10% is the difference between a transaction and a habit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a build-and-scale role, not a maintenance one. We are hiring a design leader to own a consumer experience domain within the Consumer mega alliance, raise the quality bar across it, grow a high-performing team, and build the design-technology and AI-native capability that turns ambitious ideas into beautifully executed, shipped products. We need a maker and a leader who leads through the work — not a strategy-only or people-management-only role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The level — Director or Senior Director — will be set by the candidate’s experience and the final scope of the domain. We are open to both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead from the front. &lt;/strong&gt;Lead, coach, and inspire a multidisciplinary team — UX, UI, content, and localization — across multiple consumer surfaces. Stay hands-on in the work: review designs, jump into critiques, and drive clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn ambiguity into clarity. &lt;/strong&gt;Solve problems from first principles, not templates. Help your team make hard decisions, focus on outcomes over process, and install just the right amount of structure and rigour to ship great work at speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set and uphold an extremely high craft bar. &lt;/strong&gt;From UX flow to polished UI — layout, typography, motion, micro-interaction, and visual storytelling. Be the design-quality amplifier who notices the details others miss and pushes work to where it needs to be, coaching the team to our quality tenets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own a consumer experience domain end-to-end. &lt;/strong&gt;Take accountability for the quality and delivery of experiences across the customer journey, from problem framing to shipped product across our brands and 16 markets. Drive design excellence through every detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build design-technology capability. &lt;/strong&gt;Champion and scale our design system (Zest) and modern UI foundations. Close the gap between design and engineering through prototyping, design-to-code workflows, and component quality — making design and engineering faster together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make us AI-native. &lt;/strong&gt;Treat AI as an active part of how design gets done — accelerating discovery, generating and validating prototypes, and shortening design-to-delivery. Define the quality bar AI-assisted workflows must meet, and help the company rewrite how consumer products get built in the AI era.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner deeply with Product and Engineering. &lt;/strong&gt;Align on priorities, make tradeoffs, unblock delivery, and move fast. Advocate clearly and persistently for the right experience, and raise the ambition of the partners around you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team leadership. &lt;/strong&gt;A track record of leading and growing high-performing design teams in product-first, consumer (B2C) companies — hiring, coaching, and developing designers at all levels, from IC to managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High agency. &lt;/strong&gt;You thrive in ambiguous, fast-changing environments, push for the right solution rather than the convenient one, and lean in to make things happen without waiting for permission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A bias to ship. &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated success driving teams to ship great software at scale, not just making decks about it — owning execution across a product line and a portfolio of features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional craft and product taste. &lt;/strong&gt;Strong visual and interaction sensibility and a high personal bar for detail. You know what great looks like for a consumer audience, and you can help teams get there — across hierarchy, motion, and micro-interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design-technologist mindset. &lt;/strong&gt;Fluency at the design–engineering boundary: design systems, component architecture, prototyping in code or advanced tools, and a practical grasp of front-end constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native practice. &lt;/strong&gt;You already use AI across the design workflow — for insight synthesis, rapid prototyping, and design-to-code — and have a point of view on scaling it responsibly with a high quality bar. Fluency with tools like Figma, Claude, and similar is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and systems thinking. &lt;/strong&gt;Experience designing and maintaining quality across a multi-brand or multi-market consumer ecosystem, balancing consistency with brand-specific character.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your team consistently delivers high-quality consumer product work at speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hired exceptional talent and helped your existing team grow in craft and execution maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience quality in your domain is visibly higher — the last 10% is sweated, and it shows in what customers feel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product and engineering leaders love partnering with you because you unlock progress and raise the ambition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design systems and AI-native workflows in your domain make the whole team faster without sacrificing craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a key player in shaping how HelloFresh builds consumer product in the AI era — writing new playbooks, not following old ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and impact. &lt;/strong&gt;Shape experiences for 6+ million customers across 8 brands and 16 markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A craft-and-AI-first culture. &lt;/strong&gt;Leadership that champions experience quality, innovation, and AI-native ways of working from the top of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real ownership. &lt;/strong&gt;End-to-end accountability for your domain, with the autonomy to set and raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth. &lt;/strong&gt;A defined leadership track and the chance to expand scope as the alliance scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration. &lt;/strong&gt;Work with experienced product, engineering, and design partners across HelloTech’s international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

